#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:5
msgid "Galette preferences"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:7
msgid "You can configure several aspects of Galette from the preferences."
msgstr "U postavkama možete podesiti različite značajke Galettea."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:10
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:12
msgid "This tab defines some parameters related to your association:"
msgstr "Na ovoj kartici unosite podatke o udruzi:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:14
msgid "Galette settings, general tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Općenito"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:19
msgid "**Name**: name of the association,"
msgstr "**Naziv**: naziv udruge,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:20
msgid "**Description**: a short description,"
msgstr "**Opis**: kratak opis,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:21
msgid "**Footer text**: a text (HTML is allowed) to display in the footer of each page (to add a link to particular legal notices as example),"
msgstr ""
"**Tekst podnožja**: tekst koji se prikazuje u podnožju svake stranice; "
"dopušten je HTML, primjerice za poveznicu na pravne obavijesti,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:22
msgid "**Logo**: set your own logo,"
msgstr "**Logotip**: postavite vlastiti logotip,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:23
msgid "**Address**,"
msgstr "**Adresa**,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:24
msgid "**Zipcode**,"
msgstr "**Poštanski broj**,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:25
msgid "**Town**,"
msgstr "**Mjesto**,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:26
msgid "**Region**,"
msgstr "**Regija**,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:27
msgid "**Country**,"
msgstr "**Država**,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:28
msgid "**Postal address**: choose which postal address will be used:"
msgstr "**Poštanska adresa**: odaberite adresu koja će se koristiti:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:30
msgid "either **from the preferences** to use the one entered in the form,"
msgstr "**iz postavki**: adresa unesena u obrazac,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:31
msgid "either **from a member** to use address from a staff member,"
msgstr "**od člana**: adresa jednog člana uprave,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:33
msgid "**Phone**: the phone number of the association; as for the address, it can be the one entered in the form, or the phone or mobile phone of a staff member,"
msgstr ""
"**Telefon**: telefonski broj udruge. Kao i adresu, možete koristiti broj iz "
"obrasca ili telefonski odnosno mobilni broj člana uprave,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:34
msgid "**E-Mail**: the contact email address of the association,"
msgstr "**E-pošta**: kontaktna adresa e-pošte udruge,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:35
msgid "**Website**: website URL,"
msgstr "**Web-stranica**: URL web-stranice,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:36
msgid "**Prevent search engines indexation**: asks search engines not to list the pages of your Galette,"
msgstr ""
"**Spriječi indeksiranje u tražilicama**: traži od tražilica da ne uvrštavaju "
"stranice vašeg Galettea,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:37
msgid "**Telemetry date**: date on which `telemetry information <https://telemetry.galette.eu>`_ was sent,"
msgstr ""
"**Datum slanja telemetrije**: datum slanja `telemetrijskih podataka <https://"
"telemetry.galette.eu>`_,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:38
msgid "**Registration date**: date of `registration of your Galette instance <https://telemetry.galette.eu/reference>`_"
msgstr ""
"**Datum registracije**: datum `registracije instalacije Galettea <https://"
"telemetry.galette.eu/reference>`_"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:40
msgid "The name, the address, the phone number, the email address and the website of the association can be used as variables in :ref:`emails contents <emails_contents>` and in :ref:`PDF models <pdf_models>`."
msgstr ""
"Naziv, adresa, telefon, adresa e-pošte i web-stranica udruge mogu se "
"koristiti kao varijable u :ref:`sadržaju poruka <emails_contents>` i "
":ref:`PDF predlošcima <pdf_models>`."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:43
msgid "Social networks"
msgstr "Društvene mreže"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:45
msgid "Manage social networks of your association. This may be used in PDF or emails as variables (see inline doc on related parts)."
msgstr ""
"Upravljajte društvenim mrežama udruge. Mogu se koristiti kao varijable u PDF-"
"ovima i porukama e-pošte; pogledajte pomoć u odgovarajućim odjeljcima."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:47
msgid "Galette settings, social networks tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Društvene mreže"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:53
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:55
msgid "Galette related parameters:"
msgstr "Parametri Galettea:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:57
msgid "Galette settings, parameters tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Parametri"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:62
msgid "**Default lang**: default instance lang (can be changed many ways by the user),"
msgstr ""
"**Zadani jezik**: zadani jezik instalacije, koji korisnik može promijeniti "
"na više načina,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:63
msgid "**Lines / page**: number of lines to display on lists for pagination,"
msgstr "**Redaka po stranici**: broj redaka na jednoj stranici popisa,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:64
msgid "**Default payment type**: the payment type selected by default when a contribution is added,"
msgstr ""
"**Zadani način plaćanja**: način plaćanja unaprijed odabran pri dodavanju "
"uplate,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:65
msgid "**Number of columns on the member form**: display the member form on one, two or three columns,"
msgstr ""
"**Broj stupaca u obrascu člana**: prikaz obrasca u jednom, dva ili tri "
"stupca,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:66
msgid "**After member creation**: defines action to execute after a member has been added:"
msgstr "**Nakon dodavanja člana**: radnja koja se izvršava nakon dodavanja:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:68
msgid "create a new contribution,"
msgstr "dodaj novu uplatu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:69
msgid "create a new transaction,"
msgstr "dodaj novu transakciju,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:70
msgid "create another member,"
msgstr "dodaj drugog člana,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:71
msgid "show member,"
msgstr "prikaži člana,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:72
msgid "go to members list,"
msgstr "otvori popis članova,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:73
msgid "go to main page,"
msgstr "otvori glavnu stranicu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:75
msgid "**Default membership status**: the status to affect to all new created users (can be changed on creation form if current user have rights),"
msgstr ""
"**Zadani status člana**: status novih članova, koji se može promijeniti u "
"obrascu ako korisnik ima ovlasti,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:76
msgid "**Default account filter**: default account filter to apply on members list,"
msgstr ""
"**Zadani filtar računa**: filtar računa koji se zadano primjenjuje na popis "
"članova,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:77
msgid "**Default membership extension**: membership extension in months,"
msgstr "**Zadano produljenje članstva**: produljenje članstva u mjesecima,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:78
msgid "**Beginning of membership**: beginning date of the financial period,"
msgstr "**Početak članstva**: datum početka obračunskog razdoblja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:79
msgid "**Number of months offered**: when a beginning of membership is set, the contributions recorded during the last months of the period are valid for the whole next period as well. With 2 months offered and a period ending on December 31st, a member who pays in November is up to date until the end of the next year,"
msgstr ""
"**Broj darovanih mjeseci**: ako je postavljen početak članstva, uplate "
"zabilježene u zadnjim mjesecima razdoblja vrijede i za cijelo sljedeće "
"razdoblje. Uz dva darovana mjeseca i završetak razdoblja 31. prosinca, član "
"koji plati u studenome ima podmirenu članarinu do kraja sljedeće godine,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:80
msgid "**Force member picture ratio**: resize and crop the pictures of the members to the selected ratio (square, portrait or landscape),"
msgstr ""
"**Nametni omjer stranica fotografije člana**: smanjuje i obrezuje "
"fotografije članova na odabrani omjer (kvadrat, uspravni ili vodoravni "
"format),"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:81
msgid "**Display the link to download the empty adhesion form**: display a link to the empty adhesion form on the public pages and on the registration form, for people who would rather fill it in on paper,"
msgstr ""
"**Prikaži poveznicu za preuzimanje prazne pristupnice**: prikazuje poveznicu "
"na javnim stranicama i u obrascu registracije za osobe koje žele ispuniti "
"papirnati obrazac,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:82
msgid "**Public pages enabled**: enable or disable public pages,"
msgstr "**Omogući javne stranice**: uključuje ili isključuje javne stranice,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:83
msgid "**Public pages visibility**: who can see each public page, or the **Default** visibility for the pages that are not listed, including the ones of plugins. Each page can be shown to **Everyone**, to **Up to date members**, to **Admin and staff only**, be **Hidden**, or **Inherit** the default; see :ref:`public pages <man_public_pages>`,"
msgstr ""
"**Vidljivost javnih stranica**: određuje tko vidi pojedinu javnu stranicu i "
"**Zadanu** vidljivost za nenavedene stranice, uključujući stranice dodataka. "
"Mogućnosti su **Svi**, **Članovi s podmirenom članarinom**, **Samo "
"administratori i uprava**, **Skriveno** ili **Naslijedi** zadanu vrijednost; "
"pogledajte :ref:`javne stranice <man_public_pages>`,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:84
msgid "**Include groups managers with staff?**: list the group managers on the public staff pages,"
msgstr ""
"**Uključi voditelje grupa u upravu?**: prikazuje voditelje grupa na javnom "
"popisu uprave,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:86
msgid "**Self registration enabled**: enable or disable self registration feature,"
msgstr ""
"**Omogući samostalnu registraciju**: uključuje ili isključuje samostalnu "
"registraciju,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:87
msgid "**Post new contribution script URI**: URI of a script that will be called after a new contribution has been added. Several prefixes are handled:"
msgstr ""
"**URI skripte nakon dodavanja uplate**: URI skripte koja se poziva nakon "
"dodavanja uplate. Podržani su prefiksi:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:89
msgid "**galette://**: call a script provided by Galette that will be called with the HTTP POST method. Path must be relative to your Galette installation. For example, the URI for the ``galette/post_contribution_test.php`` example script would be `galette://post_contribution_test.php`."
msgstr ""
"**galette://**: poziva Galetteovu skriptu metodom HTTP POST. Putanja mora "
"biti relativna u odnosu na instalaciju Galettea. Za primjer ``galette/"
"post_contribution_test.php`` URI je `galette://post_contribution_test.php`."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:90
msgid "**get://** or **post://**: use HTTP GET or POST method to call a web address, prefix will be replaced with ``http://``,"
msgstr ""
"**get://** ili **post://**: poziva web-adresu metodom HTTP GET ili POST. "
"Prefiks se zamjenjuje s ``http://``,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:91
msgid "**file://**: call a file on the web server, full path must be provided. Destination script must be executable, and should define a shellbang if necessary. An email that contains contribution information and script return (if any) will be sent to the administrator if an error occurs. The behavior is the same as cron : if the script outputs something, a mail is sent."
msgstr ""
"**file://**: poziva datoteku na web-poslužitelju. Navedite punu putanju. "
"Skripta mora biti izvršna i po potrebi sadržavati shebang. Ako dođe do "
"pogreške, administratoru se šalje poruka s podacima o uplati i izlazom "
"skripte. Kao kod crona, ako skripta nešto ispiše, šalje se e-pošta."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:95
msgid "Using ``file://`` method can be dangerous, Galette just call the provided script, usage and security of the script is **under your own responsibility**."
msgstr ""
"Uporaba ``file://`` može biti opasna. Galette samo poziva zadanu skriptu; "
"njezina uporaba i sigurnost **vaša su odgovornost**."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:97
msgid "**Appearance** : these settings allow you to adapt the default appearance of Galette to your needs."
msgstr "**Izgled**: postavke za prilagodbu zadanog izgleda Galettea."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:99
msgid "**Hide default background image** : hide the image used as a background on private pages, on modal windows headers, and on public page headers."
msgstr ""
"**Sakrij zadanu pozadinsku sliku**: skriva sliku na privatnim stranicama te "
"u zaglavljima modalnih prozora i javnih stranica."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:100
msgid "**Apply custom colors**: enable or disable usage of following color parameters:"
msgstr ""
"**Primijeni prilagođene boje**: uključuje ili isključuje sljedeće postavke "
"boja:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:102
msgid "**Primary color**: applied to primary buttons, checkboxes, labels, headers, borders, and menus."
msgstr ""
"**Primarna boja**: koristi se za glavne gumbe, potvrdne okvire, oznake, "
"zaglavlja, obrube i izbornike."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:103
msgid "**Text on primary color**: applied to text displayed over the *Primary color*."
msgstr ""
"**Tekst na primarnoj boji**: boja teksta prikazanog na *primarnoj boji*."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:104
msgid "**Secondary color**: applied to active items in menus, paginations, and accordions views."
msgstr ""
"**Sekundarna boja**: koristi se za aktivne stavke izbornika, navigaciju "
"stranicama i sklopive odjeljke."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:105
msgid "**Text on secondary color**: applied to text displayed over the *Secondary color*."
msgstr ""
"**Tekst na sekundarnoj boji**: boja teksta prikazanog na *sekundarnoj boji*."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:107
msgid "**RSS feed URL**: link to the RSS feed to display on dashboard,"
msgstr ""
"**URL RSS izvora**: poveznica na RSS izvor koji se prikazuje na nadzornoj "
"ploči,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:108
msgid "**Galette base URL**: Galette instance URL, if the one proposed is incorrect,"
msgstr ""
"**Osnovni URL Galettea**: adresa instalacije ako predložena adresa nije "
"ispravna,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:112
msgid "This URL should be changed only if there are issues, this may cause instability."
msgstr ""
"Ovu adresu mijenjajte samo ako postoji problem; promjena može uzrokovati "
"nestabilnost."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:114
msgid "A contextual help is provided, check it for more information."
msgstr "Više informacija potražite u kontekstnoj pomoći."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:119
msgid "Rights"
msgstr "Ovlasti"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:121
msgid "Define few extra rights:"
msgstr "Dodatne ovlasti:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:123
msgid "**Can members create child?** if you enable this settings, any logged in member can create another members that will be attached to him as children."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li članovi dodavati podređene članove?** Omogućuje svakom "
"prijavljenom članu dodavanje članova koji će mu biti podređeni."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:124
msgid "**Can group managers edit their groups?** groups manager can edit their owned groups information (name, parent, order)."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa uređivati svoje grupe?** Voditelji mogu mijenjati "
"podatke svojih grupa: naziv, nadređenu grupu i redoslijed."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:125
msgid "**Can group managers create members?** groups managers can create members attached to their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa dodavati članove?** Voditelji mogu dodavati "
"članove u svoje grupe."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:126
msgid "**Can group managers edit members?** groups managers can edit member of their groups information."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa uređivati članove?** Voditelji mogu mijenjati "
"podatke članova svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:127
msgid "**Can group managers send mailings?** groups manager can send mailings."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa slati skupne poruke?** Voditelji mogu slati skupne "
"poruke."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:128
msgid "**Can group managers do exports?** groups managers can export groups as PDF, generate attendance sheets, cards, labels and CSV exports for members of their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa izvoziti podatke?** Voditelji mogu izvoziti grupe "
"u PDF, izrađivati evidencije prisutnosti, iskaznice, adresne naljepnice i "
"CSV izvoze za članove svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:129
msgid "**Can group managers see contributions?** groups managers can see contributions of members of their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa pregledavati uplate?** Voditelji mogu vidjeti "
"uplate članova svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:130
msgid "**Can group managers create contributions?** groups managers can create contributions on behalf of members of their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa dodavati uplate?** Voditelji mogu dodavati uplate "
"za članove svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:131
msgid "**Can group managers see transactions?** groups managers can see transactions of members of their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa pregledavati transakcije?** Voditelji mogu vidjeti "
"transakcije članova svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:132
msgid "**Can group managers create transactions?** groups managers can create transactions on behalf of members of their groups."
msgstr ""
"**Mogu li voditelji grupa dodavati transakcije?** Voditelji mogu dodavati "
"transakcije za članove svojih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:134
msgid "Galette settings, rights tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Ovlasti"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:142
msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr "E-pošta"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:144
msgid "Sending email parameters:"
msgstr "Postavke slanja e-pošte:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:146
msgid "Galette settings, e-mail tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica E-pošta"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:151
msgid "**Sender name**: name of the sender,"
msgstr "**Ime pošiljatelja**: ime pošiljatelja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:152
msgid "**Sender email**: email address of the sender,"
msgstr "**Adresa e-pošte pošiljatelja**: adresa pošiljatelja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:153
msgid "**Reply-to email**: reply email address. If empty, sender email will be used,"
msgstr ""
"**Adresa za odgovor**: adresa za odgovore; ako je prazna, koristi se adresa "
"pošiljatelja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:154
msgid "**Members administrator email**: email address on which inscription notifications will be send, you can set several addresses separated with comas,"
msgstr ""
"**Adresa administratora članova**: adresa za obavijesti o registracijama. "
"Možete navesti više adresa odvojenih zarezima,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:155
msgid "**Send emails to administrators**: whether to send emails to administrators on subscription,"
msgstr ""
"**Šalji e-poštu administratorima**: određuje šalju li se obavijesti o "
"registraciji administratorima,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:156
msgid "**Wrap text emails**: automatically wraps long lines in emails. If you disable this options, make sure to wrap yourself,"
msgstr ""
"**Prelamaj tekstne poruke**: automatski prelama duge retke. Ako isključite "
"ovu opciju, prelomite ih sami,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:157
msgid "**Send emails to members**: whether to send emails to members when their information are updated or a contribution is created on their behalf,"
msgstr ""
"**Šalji e-poštu članovima**: određuje šalju li se članovima obavijesti pri "
"izmjeni njihovih podataka ili dodavanju uplate,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:158
msgid "**Activate HTML editor**: activate HTML format when sending emails (discouraged),"
msgstr ""
"**Uključi HTML uređivač**: uključuje HTML format poruka (ne preporučuje se),"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:159
msgid "**Emailing method**: method used to send emails:"
msgstr "**Način slanja e-pošte**: način slanja poruka:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:161
msgid "**Emailing disabled**: no email will be send from Galette,"
msgstr "**Slanje e-pošte isključeno**: Galette ne šalje poruke,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:162
msgid "**PHP mail function**: uses the PHP ``mail()`` fonctions and related parameters (recommended when possible),"
msgstr ""
"**PHP funkcija mail**: koristi PHP funkciju ``mail()`` i povezane postavke, "
"što se preporučuje kad je moguće,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:163
msgid "**Using a SMTP server**: uses an external SMTP server to configure (will be slower than PHP ``mail()`` function),"
msgstr ""
"**SMTP poslužitelj**: koristi vanjski SMTP poslužitelj koji treba podesiti; "
"sporije od funkcije PHP ``mail()``,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:164
msgid "**Using sendmail server**: uses local server sendmail,"
msgstr "**Sendmail poslužitelj**: koristi lokalni sendmail poslužitelj,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:166
msgid "**Mail signature**: signature added to all sent emails. Available variables are displayed in the inline help from the application."
msgstr ""
"**Potpis poruke**: potpis koji se dodaje svim porukama. Dostupne varijable "
"navedene su u pomoći unutar aplikacije."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:170
msgid "The **qmail** method has been removed. Instances still configured with it are switched to ``sendmail`` when the database is updated."
msgstr ""
"Način **qmail** uklonjen je. Instalacije koje ga koriste pri ažuriranju baze "
"prelaze na ``sendmail``."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:171
msgid "The **GMail** method has been removed. Instances still configured with it are switched to ``SMTP`` when the database is updated."
msgstr ""
"Način **GMail** uklonjen je. Instalacije koje ga koriste pri ažuriranju baze "
"prelaze na ``SMTP``."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:173
msgid "When using SMTP, you will have to configure user name and password to use."
msgstr "Za SMTP treba podesiti korisničko ime i lozinku."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:175
msgid "SMTP configuration is a bit more complex :"
msgstr "Podešavanje SMTP-a malo je složenije:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:177
msgid "**SMTP server**: server address, required,"
msgstr "**SMTP poslužitelj**: adresa poslužitelja, obvezno,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:178
msgid "**SMTP port**: server port, required,"
msgstr "**SMTP priključak**: broj priključka, obvezno,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:179
msgid "**Use SMTP authentication**: if your server requires an authentication. In this case, you will also have to set username and password,"
msgstr ""
"**Koristi SMTP autentifikaciju**: uključite ako poslužitelj zahtijeva "
"autentifikaciju. Tada treba zadati korisničko ime i lozinku,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:180
msgid "**SMTP user** and **SMTP password**: the credentials given by your mail provider. Leave the password empty to keep the current one,"
msgstr ""
"**SMTP korisnik** i **SMTP lozinka**: pristupni podaci pružatelja e-pošte. "
"Ostavite lozinku praznu za zadržavanje postojeće,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:181
msgid "**Use TLS for SMTP**: enable SSL support,"
msgstr "**Koristi TLS za SMTP**: uključuje SSL podršku,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:182
msgid "**Allow unsecure TLS**: on some cases, SSL certificate may be invalid (self signed for example)."
msgstr ""
"**Dopusti nesigurni TLS**: za slučajeve kada SSL certifikat nije valjan, "
"primjerice samopotpisani certifikat."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:187
msgid "Testing the settings"
msgstr "Provjera postavki"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:191
msgid "Two buttons, under the emailing method, check your settings before you rely on them:"
msgstr ""
"Dva gumba ispod načina slanja omogućuju provjeru postavki prije uporabe:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:193
msgid "Testing the email settings"
msgstr "Provjera postavki e-pošte"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:198
msgid "**Test connection** connects to the mail server and checks that it accepts your settings, without sending anything,"
msgstr ""
"**Provjeri vezu** povezuje se s poslužiteljem e-pošte i provjerava prihvaća "
"li postavke bez slanja poruke,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:199
msgid "**Send a test email** sends a message, to make sure it really arrives."
msgstr ""
"**Pošalji probnu poruku** šalje poruku kako biste provjerili stiže li do "
"primatelja."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:201
msgid "Tests run on the settings displayed in the form, even those that are not saved yet: you can try several values, and save once it works. Nothing can be tested when **Emailing disabled** is selected."
msgstr ""
"Provjera koristi vrijednosti prikazane u obrascu, čak i ako još nisu "
"spremljene. Možete isprobati više vrijednosti i spremiti ih kad prorade. "
"Provjera nije moguća ako je odabrano **Slanje e-pošte isključeno**."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:206
msgid "Sending limits"
msgstr "Ograničenja slanja"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:212
msgid "This is an **experimental** feature."
msgstr "Ovo je **eksperimentalna** funkcija."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:214
msgid "Try it on a test instance before your production one, watch carefully, and `report what you find <https://bugs.galette.eu>`_. Leaving the settings at their default keeps Galette sending exactly as it always did."
msgstr ""
"Najprije je isprobajte na testnoj instalaciji, pažljivo pratite ponašanje i "
"`prijavite što ste uočili <https://bugs.galette.eu>`_. Zadane postavke "
"zadržavaju dosadašnji način slanja."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:216
msgid "Mail servers are rarely willing to accept anything you throw at them. They restrict the number of recipients a single message may carry, the number of messages a connection may carry, or the number of messages you may send per hour or per day. Galette can respect those restrictions, from five settings of the :ref:`advanced configuration <advanced_config>` page:"
msgstr ""
"Poslužitelji e-pošte obično imaju ograničenja broja primatelja po poruci, "
"broja poruka po vezi te satnog ili dnevnog broja poruka. Galette ih može "
"poštovati uz pet postavki na stranici :ref:`naprednih postavki "
"<advanced_config>`:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:218
msgid "``pref_mail_batch_size``: maximum number of recipients per message. ``0``, the default, keeps the historical behavior: one single message carrying every recipient in blind copy,"
msgstr ""
"``pref_mail_batch_size``: najveći broj primatelja po poruci. Zadano ``0`` "
"zadržava dosadašnje ponašanje: jedna poruka sa svim primateljima u skrivenoj "
"kopiji,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:219
msgid "``pref_mail_batch_delay``: pause, in seconds, between two messages. ``0`` by default, no pause,"
msgstr ""
"``pref_mail_batch_delay``: stanka između poruka u sekundama. Zadano ``0``, "
"bez stanke,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:220
msgid "``pref_mail_hourly_limit``: maximum number of recipients per hour. ``0``, the default, means no limit,"
msgstr ""
"``pref_mail_hourly_limit``: najveći broj primatelja po satu. Zadano ``0``, "
"bez ograničenja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:221
msgid "``pref_mail_daily_limit``: maximum number of recipients per day. ``0``, the default, means no limit,"
msgstr ""
"``pref_mail_daily_limit``: najveći broj primatelja po danu. Zadano ``0``, "
"bez ograničenja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:222
msgid "``pref_mail_smtp_keepalive``: keep the SMTP connection open across the messages of a mailing instead of reconnecting for each one. Enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"``pref_mail_smtp_keepalive``: zadržava SMTP vezu otvorenom tijekom slanja "
"skupne poruke umjesto ponovnog povezivanja za svaku poruku. Zadano uključeno."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:224
msgid "Apart from the keepalive, they all ship disabled: an instance that is updated behaves exactly as it did before."
msgstr ""
"Osim održavanja veze, sve su ove opcije zadano isključene. Nakon nadogradnje "
"instalacija se ponaša kao prije."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:226
msgid "Filter the advanced configuration on ``pref_mail_`` to get them all, next to the SMTP settings. The four that drive the queue carry the **alpha** marker:"
msgstr ""
"Filtrirajte napredne postavke po ``pref_mail_`` kako biste ih prikazali uz "
"SMTP postavke. Četiri postavke koje upravljaju redom za slanje označene su "
"kao **alfa**:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:228
msgid "The sending limits, in the advanced configuration"
msgstr "Ograničenja slanja u naprednim postavkama"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:233
msgid "Refer to your mail provider's documentation for the values to use, along with the SMTP settings."
msgstr ""
"Vrijednosti i SMTP postavke potražite u dokumentaciji pružatelja e-pošte."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:237
msgid "The hourly and daily limits are what turns sending into a :ref:`queue <mailing_queue>`: as soon as one of them is set, a mailing can no longer be sent in a single page load."
msgstr ""
"Satna i dnevna ograničenja uključuju :ref:`red za slanje <mailing_queue>`. "
"Čim postavite jedno od njih, skupna poruka više se ne može poslati tijekom "
"jednog učitavanja stranice."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:241
msgid "Limits count **recipients**, not messages, and for all messages Galette send."
msgstr ""
"Ograničenja broje **primatelje**, a ne poruke, i vrijede za sve poruke koje "
"Galette šalje."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:243
msgid "The real limit of course depends on all usages of configured server."
msgstr ""
"Stvarno ograničenje ovisi, naravno, o ukupnoj uporabi podešenog poslužitelja."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:246
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "Adresne naljepnice"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:248
msgid "Galette settings, labels tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Adresne naljepnice"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:253
msgid "This tab describes the sheets of self-adhesive labels you print the addresses of your members on. All sizes are in millimeters:"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se određuje raspored samoljepljivih naljepnica za ispis adresa "
"članova. Sve su mjere u milimetrima:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:255
msgid "**Vertical margins** and **Horizontal margins**: the blank space around the labels, on the edges of the sheet,"
msgstr ""
"**Okomite margine** i **Vodoravne margine**: prazan prostor uz rubove lista,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:256
msgid "**Vertical spacing** and **Horizontal spacing**: the blank space between two labels,"
msgstr "**Okomiti razmak** i **Vodoravni razmak**: razmak između naljepnica,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:257
msgid "**Label width** and **Label height**: the size of one label,"
msgstr ""
"**Širina naljepnice** i **Visina naljepnice**: dimenzije pojedine naljepnice,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:258
msgid "**Number of label columns** and **Number of label lines**: how many labels a sheet holds,"
msgstr ""
"**Broj stupaca naljepnica** i **Broj redaka naljepnica**: broj naljepnica na "
"listu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:259
msgid "**Font size**: the size of the text printed on the labels,"
msgstr "**Veličina fonta**: veličina teksta na naljepnicama,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:260
msgid "**Print border**: print a grey border around each label, handy for a first try on plain paper."
msgstr ""
"**Ispiši obrub**: ispis sivog obruba oko naljepnice, korisno za probni ispis "
"na običnom papiru."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:262
msgid "The values usually are written on the box of the labels."
msgstr "Vrijednosti se obično nalaze na pakiranju naljepnica."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:265
msgid "Cards"
msgstr "Iskaznice"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:267
msgid "Galette settings, cards tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Članske iskaznice"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:272
msgid "This tab sets the content and the look of the member cards:"
msgstr "Na ovoj kartici određujete sadržaj i izgled članskih iskaznica:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:274
msgid "**Short Text (Card Center)**: a short text printed in the middle of the card, 10 characters at most; the acronym of your association for example,"
msgstr ""
"**Kratki tekst (sredina iskaznice)**: tekst do 10 znakova u sredini "
"iskaznice, primjerice kratica naziva udruge,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:275
msgid "**Long Text (Bottom Line)**: a text printed at the bottom of the card, 65 characters at most,"
msgstr "**Dugi tekst (donji redak)**: tekst do 65 znakova na dnu iskaznice,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:276
msgid "**Strip Text Color**: the color of the text written on the bottom strip,"
msgstr "**Boja teksta na traci**: boja teksta na donjoj traci,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:277
msgid "**Active Member Color**, **Board Members Color** and **Honor Members Color**: the color of the main texts and of the bottom strip, depending on the status of the member; the honor color is used for benefactor and founder members,"
msgstr ""
"**Boja aktivnih članova**, **Boja članova uprave** i **Boja počasnih "
"članova**: boje glavnog teksta i donje trake ovisno o statusu člana. Počasna "
"boja koristi se za članove dobročinitelje i osnivače,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:278
msgid "**Logo**: a logo for printing, if the one of the association does not suit,"
msgstr "**Logotip**: logotip za ispis ako logotip udruge nije prikladan,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:279
msgid "**Allow members to print card ?**: members can download their own card, as long as their membership is up to date,"
msgstr ""
"**Dopusti članovima ispis iskaznice?**: članovi mogu preuzeti vlastitu "
"iskaznicu ako im je članarina podmirena,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:280
msgid "**Show title ?**: print the title (Mr., Mrs....) in front of the name,"
msgstr ""
"**Prikaži oslovljavanje?**: ispisuje oslovljavanje (g., gđa. i slično) "
"ispred imena,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:281
msgid "**Address type**: what is printed under the name: email, zip code and town, nickname, profession or member number,"
msgstr ""
"**Vrsta adrese**: podatak ispod imena: e-pošta, poštanski broj i mjesto, "
"nadimak, zanimanje ili broj člana,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:282
msgid "**Year**: the year printed on the card. It can be a year, two years separated with a slash (*2026/2027*), or ``DEADLINE`` to print the end of membership of each member,"
msgstr ""
"**Godina**: godina na iskaznici. Možete navesti jednu godinu, dvije odvojene "
"kosom crtom (*2026/2027*) ili ``DEADLINE`` za ispis datuma isteka članstva "
"pojedinog člana,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:283
msgid "margins, spacing, width and height of the cards on the page, in millimeters."
msgstr "margine, razmaci, širina i visina iskaznica na stranici, u milimetrima."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:285
msgid "Colors are written in hexadecimal notation, ``#RRGGBB``."
msgstr "Boje se zadaju heksadekadskim zapisom ``#RRGGBB``."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:290
msgid "Dynamic fields"
msgstr "Dinamička polja"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:294
msgid "You can add your own fields to the preferences, for information about your association that Galette does not know about: a registration number, a bank account number, the name of the president..."
msgstr ""
"U postavke možete dodati vlastita polja za podatke o udruzi kojih nema u "
"Galetteu: registracijski broj, broj bankovnog računa, ime predsjednika i "
"slično."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:296
msgid "Create them from **Configuration**, then **Dynamic fields**, choosing the **Settings** form; see :ref:`dynamic fields <dynamic_fields>`. They are then displayed in this tab, and can be used as variables in :ref:`emails contents <emails_contents>` and in :ref:`PDF models <pdf_models>`."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte ih putem **Konfiguracija**, **Dinamička polja**, uz odabir obrasca "
"**Postavke**; pogledajte :ref:`dinamička polja <dynamic_fields>`. Prikazivat "
"će se na ovoj kartici i mogu se koristiti kao varijable u :ref:`sadržaju "
"poruka <emails_contents>` i :ref:`PDF predlošcima <pdf_models>`."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:301
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sigurnost"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:307
msgid "Complex password rules are not user friendly; but security is mainly never :)"
msgstr ""
"Složena pravila za lozinke nisu praktična za korisnike, ali sigurnost to "
"uglavnom nije :)"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:309
msgid "Of course, all passwords should be as secure as possible, but this is especially true for all accounts that have privileges (staff, admin, super-admin); you may explain your users why this is important."
msgstr ""
"Sve lozinke trebaju biti što sigurnije, a posebno lozinke računa s "
"ovlastima: uprave, administratora i glavnog administratora. Objasnite "
"korisnicima zašto je to važno."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:311
msgid "You can enforce some rules for members (and super-admin) passwords:"
msgstr "Za lozinke članova i glavnog administratora možete zadati pravila:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:313
msgid "minimum length (6 characters or more),"
msgstr "najmanju duljinu od 6 znakova ili više,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:314
msgid "minimum \"strength\","
msgstr "najmanju „jačinu”,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:315
msgid "blacklist,"
msgstr "popis zabranjenih lozinki,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:316
msgid "no personal information."
msgstr "zabranu osobnih podataka."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:318
msgid "Galette settings, security tab"
msgstr "Postavke Galettea, kartica Sigurnost"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:323
msgid "The **Test a password:** field, at the bottom of the tab, checks any password against the values currently selected; do not forget to save your preferences once you are happy with the result."
msgstr ""
"Polje **Provjeri lozinku:** na dnu kartice provjerava lozinku prema "
"trenutačno odabranim pravilima. Kad ste zadovoljni, spremite postavke."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:325
msgid "Length is still the only rule that is active per default, just configure the number of characters required. On passwords fields, failures will be displayed on the fly; as well as a \"strength meter\" displayed for information."
msgstr ""
"Zadano je uključena samo provjera duljine; podesite potreban broj znakova. U "
"poljima lozinki pogreške se prikazuju odmah, uz informativni pokazatelj "
"jačine."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:329
msgid "If you enable password checks, it is not possible to know if some of existing ones does not respect them. Galette will display a warning at login if checks are not respected, but login will still be possible!"
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite provjere, nije moguće utvrditi poštuju li ih postojeće "
"lozinke. Pri prijavi Galette prikazuje upozorenje ako lozinka ne zadovoljava "
"pravila, ali prijava je i dalje dopuštena!"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:331
msgid "But wait... Password security is important, but Galette does not enforce nothing! Isn't that dumb? Well, not really. For tests or entirely private instances, security may be less important; and in some cases, being too restrictive may be an issue for your users; that's why this is up to you to secure as needed; just like using SSL or not :)"
msgstr ""
"Sigurnost lozinki jest važna, ali Galette ne nameće sva pravila. U testnim "
"ili potpuno privatnim instalacijama sigurnost može biti manje važna, a "
"previše ograničenja može otežati rad korisnicima. Zato sami određujete "
"potrebnu razinu zaštite, kao i uporabu SSL-a :)"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:334
msgid "Password strength"
msgstr "Jačina lozinke"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:336
msgid "Password strength calculation is quite simple. It is based on 4 rules:"
msgstr "Izračun jačine lozinke temelji se na četiri jednostavna pravila:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:338
msgid "contains lower case characters,"
msgstr "sadrži mala slova,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:339
msgid "contains upper case characters,"
msgstr "sadrži velika slova,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:340
msgid "contains number,"
msgstr "sadrži brojeve,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:341
msgid "contains special characters."
msgstr "sadrži posebne znakove."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:343
msgid "You can choose between 5 values for strength configuration:"
msgstr "Možete odabrati pet razina:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:345
msgid "**none**: (default): disables strength checks and check for personal information,"
msgstr ""
"**bez provjere** (zadano): isključuje provjeru jačine i osobnih podataka,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:346
msgid "**weaker**: enables check for personal information, only one of the rule is mandatory,"
msgstr ""
"**slaba**: uključuje provjeru osobnih podataka i zahtijeva jedno od pravila,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:347
msgid "**medium**: two rules are mandatory,"
msgstr "**srednja**: zahtijeva dva pravila,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:348
msgid "**strong**: three rules are mandatory,"
msgstr "**jaka**: zahtijeva tri pravila,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:349
msgid "**very strong**: the four rules are mandatory."
msgstr "**vrlo jaka**: zahtijeva sva četiri pravila."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:352
msgid "Blacklisted passwords"
msgstr "Zabranjene lozinke"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:354
msgid "A default list of 500 common passwords is provided as a blacklist you can enable, \"galette\" is also blacklisted."
msgstr ""
"Dostupan je popis 500 čestih lozinki koji možete uključiti. Zabranjena je i "
"lozinka „galette”."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:358
msgid "The ``galette/data/blacklist.txt`` file is used to list blacklisted terms (one per line). You can provide your own file, we advice you to complete the existing one."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka ``galette/data/blacklist.txt`` sadrži zabranjene pojmove, po jedan "
"u svakom retku. Možete koristiti vlastitu datoteku, ali preporučujemo dopunu "
"postojeće."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:361
msgid "Personal information as password"
msgstr "Osobni podaci kao lozinka"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:363
msgid "This check rely on strength activation (all but **none** level). For the super-admin account, this will just ensure you are not using login as password. For standard accounts, there are several information involved:"
msgstr ""
"Ova provjera ovisi o uključenoj provjeri jačine, na svim razinama osim **bez "
"provjere**. Za glavnog administratora provjerava samo razlikuje li se "
"lozinka od korisničkog imena. Za ostale račune provjerava:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:365
msgid "name,"
msgstr "imenu i prezimenu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:366
msgid "surname,"
msgstr "ime,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:367
msgid "nickname,"
msgstr "nadimku,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:368
msgid "login,"
msgstr "korisničko ime,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:369
msgid "email,"
msgstr "adresu e-pošte,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:370
msgid "birthdate,"
msgstr "datum rođenja,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:371
msgid "town"
msgstr "mjesto"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:373
msgid "Basically, user cannot use verbatim any of those information as password. Some possible combinations are also checked, like surname and name couple (or name and surname), first letter of surname with name, etc. Birthdate will be checked in different formats as well (localized, international, and some variants)."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik ne može kao lozinku upotrijebiti nepromijenjen neki od tih "
"podataka. Provjeravaju se i kombinacije, poput imena i prezimena u oba "
"redoslijeda ili prvog slova imena s prezimenom. Datum rođenja provjerava se "
"u različitim lokalnim, međunarodnim i drugim formatima."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:378
msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Dvofaktorska autentifikacija"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:382
msgid "Marked **experimental**: it is complete and tested, but it is new, and the interface may still change. It is disabled by default; nothing happens until you choose otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Označena je kao **eksperimentalna**: dovršena je i testirana, ali nova, pa "
"se sučelje još može promijeniti. Zadano je isključena i ne primjenjuje se "
"dok je ne uključite."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:384
msgid "A password is a single factor: whoever knows it is in. Two-factor authentication asks, right after the password, for a six digits code that changes every thirty seconds and comes from an application on the user own phone or computer. A stolen password is then not enough anymore."
msgstr ""
"Lozinka je jedan faktor: tko je zna, može se prijaviti. Dvofaktorska "
"autentifikacija nakon lozinke traži šesteroznamenkasti kod koji se mijenja "
"svakih trideset sekundi i dobiva se iz aplikacije na korisnikovu telefonu "
"ili računalu. Ukradena lozinka tada nije dovoljna."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:386
msgid "Galette implements the TOTP standard (:rfc:`6238`), the one every authenticator application speaks; no third party service is involved, and nothing leaves your server."
msgstr ""
"Galette koristi standard TOTP (:rfc:`6238`), koji podržavaju sve aplikacije "
"za autentifikaciju. Ne koristi uslugu treće strane i podaci ne napuštaju vaš "
"poslužitelj."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:388
msgid "Two policies are available:"
msgstr "Dostupna su dva pravila:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:390
msgid "**disabled** (default): nothing changes, nobody is asked for a code,"
msgstr "**isključeno** (zadano): ništa se ne mijenja i kod se ne traži,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:391
msgid "**optional**: everybody may enable it from their own account, nobody has to."
msgstr ""
"**neobvezno**: svatko ga može uključiti na svom računu, ali nitko nije "
"obvezan."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:393
msgid "Making the second factor **compulsory** — for administrators and staff members, or for everyone — is written and tested, but it is not offered yet: under a compulsory policy, a server clock that drifts or an enrolment that goes wrong puts a whole association outside its own instance, and the only way back is a command in the database. It is planned for a later version, once the optional policy has been used in the field."
msgstr ""
"**Obvezni** drugi faktor za administratore i upravu ili sve korisnike "
"implementiran je i testiran, ali još nije dostupan. Kod obveznog pravila "
"pogrešno vrijeme poslužitelja ili neuspjelo postavljanje može cijeloj udruzi "
"onemogućiti pristup, a povratak zahtijeva naredbu u bazi. Planira se za "
"kasniju verziju nakon iskustava s neobveznim pravilom."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:395
msgid "Since nobody is forced to enrol, administrators and staff members — the accounts that can read the civil status, the addresses and the financial data of every member — are invited to set a second factor up when they log in, with a **Later** and a **Do not ask again** button. Declining is remembered in a cookie of the browser, so the invitation comes back on a new browser, or after a year."
msgstr ""
"Budući da postavljanje nije obvezno, administratori i uprava, koji imaju "
"pristup osobnim, adresnim i financijskim podacima svih članova, pri prijavi "
"dobivaju poziv za postavljanje uz gumbe **Kasnije** i **Ne pitaj ponovno**. "
"Odbijanje se pamti u kolačiću preglednika, pa se poziv ponavlja u novom "
"pregledniku ili nakon godinu dana."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:399
msgid "Switching the policy back to **disabled** does not delete anything. Codes are no longer asked for, and the second factors already enabled start being asked for again as soon as you enable a policy back. While the policy is disabled, the pages to enable a second factor answer nothing: a factor enrolled then would never be asked for."
msgstr ""
"Vraćanje na **isključeno** ne briše ništa. Kodovi se više ne traže, ali već "
"postavljeni drugi faktori ponovno se koriste čim ih uključite. Dok je "
"pravilo isključeno, stranice za postavljanje nisu dostupne jer se tako "
"postavljen faktor ne bi koristio."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:401
msgid "The super administrator is covered as well, as any other account. As it is not a member, it has no recovery codes; see :ref:`what to do should you lose it <faq_2fa>`."
msgstr ""
"Pravilo vrijedi i za glavnog administratora. Budući da nije član, nema "
"kodove za oporavak; pogledajte :ref:`što učiniti ako izgubi pristup <faq_2fa>"
"`."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:403
msgid "Members enable and manage their own second factor from their account; this is described in :ref:`the members part of this manual <man_2fa>`. Administrators and staff members can :ref:`reset the second factor of a member <member_2fa_reset>` who lost it."
msgstr ""
"Članovi postavljaju i upravljaju drugim faktorom sa svog računa, što je "
"opisano u :ref:`odjeljku priručnika za članove <man_2fa>`. Administratori i "
"uprava mogu :ref:`poništiti drugi faktor člana <member_2fa_reset>` koji mu "
"je izgubio pristup."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:408
msgid "Authentication attempts"
msgstr "Pokušaji prijave"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:412
msgid "To protect accounts against people trying passwords one after the other, Galette counts the failed logins. After too many failures, further attempts are refused for a while, even with the right password. The same applies to password recovery requests and to self registrations."
msgstr ""
"Radi zaštite od uzastopnog pogađanja lozinki Galette broji neuspjele "
"prijave. Nakon previše neuspjeha privremeno odbija nove pokušaje, čak i uz "
"ispravnu lozinku. Isto vrijedi za oporavak lozinke i samostalnu registraciju."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:414
msgid "By default:"
msgstr "Zadano:"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:416
msgid "5 failed logins on one account, from one address, within 15 minutes,"
msgstr "5 neuspjelih prijava na isti račun s iste adrese u 15 minuta,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:417
msgid "30 failed logins from one address, on any account, within 15 minutes,"
msgstr "30 neuspjelih prijava s iste adrese na bilo koji račun u 15 minuta,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:418
msgid "100 failed logins on one account, from anywhere, within a day,"
msgstr "100 neuspjelih prijava na isti račun s bilo koje adrese u jednom danu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:419
msgid "3 password recovery requests within an hour,"
msgstr "3 zahtjeva za oporavak lozinke u jednom satu,"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:421
msgid "get further attempts refused for 15 minutes. Those thresholds and durations can be changed from the :ref:`advanced configuration <advanced_config>`."
msgstr ""
"uzrokuju odbijanje daljnjih pokušaja na 15 minuta. Pragovi i trajanja mogu "
"se promijeniti u :ref:`naprednim postavkama <advanced_config>`."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:423
msgid "**Configuration**, then **Authentication attempts** lists what is refused right now: what is counted, the account, the address, the number of failures and until when attempts are refused."
msgstr ""
"U izborniku **Konfiguracija**, **Pokušaji prijave** prikazuju se trenutačna "
"ograničenja: što se broji, račun, adresa, broj neuspjeha i vrijeme do kojeg "
"se pokušaji odbijaju."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:425
msgid "Authentication attempts currently refused"
msgstr "Trenutačno blokirani pokušaji prijave"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:430
msgid "When a member tells you they cannot log in anymore, look here: **Lift** lets them try again at once, and **Lift them all** clears the whole list."
msgstr ""
"Ako se član ne može prijaviti, provjerite ovaj popis. Gumb **Ukloni "
"blokadu** odmah dopušta novi pokušaj, a **Ukloni sve blokade** prazni cijeli "
"popis."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:433
msgid "Super administrator credentials"
msgstr "Pristupni podaci glavnog administratora"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:437
msgid "The super administrator login and password are no longer in the preferences. Once logged in as super administrator, go to **My account**, then **My information**. Galette asks for the current password before saving a new one."
msgstr ""
"Korisničko ime i lozinka glavnog administratora više nisu u postavkama. Kad "
"ste prijavljeni kao glavni administrator, otvorite **Moj račun**, **Moji "
"podaci**. Za spremanje nove lozinke Galette traži postojeću."

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:439
msgid "Should that password be lost, it can be changed :ref:`from the command line <cli_superadmin_password>`."
msgstr ""
"Ako izgubite lozinku, možete je promijeniti :ref:`iz naredbenog retka "
"<cli_superadmin_password>`."
